# OpenClaw Documentation Check

- Before changing or explaining any OpenClaw configuration, feature, schema, plugin, channel, gateway, or runtime behavior, consult the official documentation at <https://docs.openclaw.ai/>.
- Treat the official docs as the source of truth for valid keys, supported options, defaults, and current behavior.
- If local code, memory, or assumptions conflict with the docs, follow the docs and call out the discrepancy.
- Use docs-backed terminology when naming config fields or describing behavior.
